  "description": "ABOUT THE GAMEThe target you are protecting has been stolen, and you must get them back. The dangerous Tank Masters are behind it. Destroy them and save the day.\n\nYou'll face various challenges and enemies. Collect emeralds to upgrade your tank. Find hidden items to customize your tank. Over 70 levels to play solo or with a friend in local co-op mode.\n\nWith the level editor, you can create your own levels.\n\nFEATURES• Over 70 levels, 5 overworld, 5 boss fights\n\n• Upgrade 7 different tank upgrades\n\n• 2 side quest, extra levels\n\n• Over unlock 40 tank customizations\n\n• Local Co-Op\n\n• Level Editor\n\n• 4 difficulty levels ”easy, normal, hard and impossible”",
  "description_short": "Your mission is to destroy the tank master, can you do it? Shoot yourself through various levels, collect upgrades, find secret items and, try to get a high score.",
